n style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>US: Retail Sales</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>US Earnings: AMAT</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>JP Earnings: Honda Motor</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>CN Earnings: Hua Hong Semiconductor</span></td><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>15</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>Global: Trump - Xi</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>KR: Export Price</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>US: Powell Chair Term Ends</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>JP Earnings: MUFG, Mizuho, Kioxia</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>KR Earnings: Hanmi Semiconductor</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>CN Earnings: Meituan, NetEase, Kuaishou</span></td></tr><tr><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>18</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>CN: House Price, Industrial Production, Retail Sales, Fixed Asset Investment</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>Global: G7 Finance Minister & Central Bank Meeting</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>CN Earnings: Baidu</span></td><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>19</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>JP: GDP 1Q26 (Preliminary)</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>G