span></td></tr><tr><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>8</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>Apple: WWDC 2026</span></td><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>9</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>CN: Exports</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>TW: Exports</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>Mizuho Conference: SanDisk, Lumentum</span></td><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>10</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>CN: CPI</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>TSMC: Monthly Revenue (May)</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>US: CPI</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>US Earnings: Oracle, Adobe</span></td><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>11</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>KR: Exports First 10 Days</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>EA: ECB Meeting</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>US: PPI</span></td><td style=''border:1px solid #e6e9ee;vertical-align:top;padding:7px 8px;line-height:1.4;''><span style=''font-weight:bold;color:#0c244a;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;''>12</span><span style=''display:block;color:#1a2e44;margin:1px 0;''>IN: CPI</span></td></tr><tr